# Binary search trees

**Course:** CS201 · **Date:** 2026-10-17 · **Lecturer:** Prof. Lin

%% This is a complete example note. Open the preview with Cmd+K V and
   run "YAMD: Toggle Quiz Mode" to hide the cloze answers. %%

